<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115715" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψί̆θῠρ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>whispering, slanderous,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					148
				</span></i>
			 (anap.): as epith. of Aphrodite, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.Gr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				330
			</span></i>: as Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψίθυρος, ὁ,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψιθυριστής</span>
			, <i>whisperer, slanderer,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				2.75
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				167
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Si.</u>
				5.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.727d
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>Hann.</u>
					46
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>twittering,</i> of birds, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				12.136
			</span></i>; so of music, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψίθυρον εὐήθη νόμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					671
				</span></i>
			.</div>
